{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_054AD0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你这个是<R=代号,CODE NAME>吗？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=代号,CODE NAME>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":38,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"不，只是个绰号。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"不知道吗？Kubrick的《<R=奇爱博士,DR. STRANGELOVE>，或：我如何学会停止担忧并爱上氢弹》。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=奇爱博士,DR. STRANGELOVE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"1964年的电影……是一部讽刺核威慑的黑色喜剧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":64,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"你演过那部电影？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"怎么可能！就是因为那部电影，我才被人起了这个绰号。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"你和电影里的博士很像吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"不。那个博士是男人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"那为什么……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"我在<R=高级研究计划局,ARPA>的时候，会在自己的座位上摆着<R=她,THE BOSS>的照片。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=高级研究计划局,ARPA>\", \"<R=她,THE BOSS>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":106,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"对异性恋爱毫无兴趣，只顾埋头研究，座位上还摆着女人的照片……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"周围那群蠢货就拿这取笑我，把这种“异常的爱”叫作“Strangelove”，还用它来称呼我。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":116,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"看来就连那些不看电影的家伙，也对那个片名印象深刻。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"总之，在他们眼里，同性恋大概是种<R=奇怪,STRANGE>的东西吧。那帮人只会用自己的标准看待事物。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=奇怪,STRANGE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":129,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"所谓<R=奇怪,STRANGE>，也意味着拥有独特的视角。我反而以此为傲。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=奇怪,STRANGE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"}]}